  "templates": [
    {
      "name": "Voodflow Builder · Product landing",
      "category": "Landing pages",
      "description": "Complete VoodBuilder product landing (mobile-first grids: stack below lg). Free Unsplash images. Theme tokens + Tailwind. No nav/footer.",
      "html": "<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section relative overflow-hidden bg-vp-bg-alt py-24 text-vp-text-2 sm:py-28\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-hero\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"absolute -left-20 top-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1/25 blur-3xl\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-2/20 blur-3xl\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-8 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-vp-brand-1\">Voodflow · VoodBuilder</p>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-vp-text-1 sm:text-6xl\">Visual page builder for Laravel &amp; Filament</h1>\n      <p class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Build and publish marketing sites inside Laravel and Filament: a visual editor, Theme Studio, shared layouts, navigation and Tailwind CSS — all in one stack.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit max-w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl bg-vp-brand-1 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-vp-bg transition hover:bg-vp-brand-2 sm:px-7 sm:py-3 sm:text-sm\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Explore Voodflow</a>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit max-w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-vp-text-1 transition hover:bg-vp-bg sm:px-7 sm:py-3 sm:text-sm\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">See features</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-sm text-vp-text-3\">Community free core · Pro companions when you need them · Built for Laravel 12/13 &amp; Filament 5</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=680&q=80\" alt=\"VoodBuilder visual editor canvas\" class=\"h-auto w-full max-w-full object-cover\" width=\"1200\" height=\"680\" loading=\"eager\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-features\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">Features</p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">What you get with VoodBuilder</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">A production-ready visual CMS shell for marketing sites, landings and content channels — designed for teams that ship on Laravel.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\">\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Visual editor</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Drag-and-drop canvas, device previews, undo/redo, revision history, autosave and a Style inspector tuned for Tailwind CSS.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Community core</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Layout, Basic, Media and Site blocks plus local marketing sections — free to use, source-available, ready for production.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Theme Studio</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Map colours and sub-themes to Site pages and content channels. Light/dark tokens stay consistent on the live site.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Chrome layouts</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Shared header and footer shells per channel, edited in the same builder as your pages — no separate frontend app.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Menu-driven URLs</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Pages get public routes from Navigation — clean paths like <span class=\"text-vp-text-1\">/about</span> or nested menu trees.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-7 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Access gates</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Public, registered-only, profile-based access and optional password unlock — controlled from Filament.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg-alt py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-blueprint\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">Inside the product</p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">VoodBuilder blueprint: Laravel-native by design</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Simplicity, best practices and performance — without a headless detour.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"space-y-16\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">Built for Filament teams</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Editors stay in the admin they already know. Developers keep Composer packages, policies and deploy pipelines. VoodBuilder registers as a Filament plugin and ships with your app.</p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-vp-text-2\">\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> PHP 8.4 · Laravel 12/13 · Filament 5</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Vite + Tailwind CSS v4 in the host app</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Media via voodflow/vmedia</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=960&h=640&q=80\" alt=\"Filament admin with VoodBuilder\" class=\"h-auto w-full max-w-full object-cover\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10\">\n        <div class=\"order-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl ring-1 ring-black/5 lg:order-1\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561070791-2526d30994b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=960&h=640&q=80\" alt=\"Theme Studio colour mapping\" class=\"h-auto w-full max-w-full object-cover\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"order-1 space-y-4 lg:order-2\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">Theme tokens that survive dark mode</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Sections use <span class=\"text-vp-text-1\">bg-vp-*</span> / <span class=\"text-vp-text-1\">text-vp-*</span> utilities. Theme Studio maps brand colours once; pages and chrome stay aligned across light and dark.</p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-vp-text-2\">\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Sub-themes per channel</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Self-hosted fonts — no Google Fonts CDN in Core</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Page JIT compiles Tailwind on canvas and publish</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">Grow with companions</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Core consumes; companions author. Add Elements, Components, Templates, Dynamic Data, Popups or verticals when the product needs them — soft-gated, same editor.</p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-vp-text-2\">\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Elements — official remote section catalog</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Components — reusable blocks you save</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-vp-brand-1\">✓</span> Templates — page kits and future marketplace</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=960&h=640&q=80\" alt=\"VoodBuilder companion packages\" class=\"h-auto w-full max-w-full object-cover\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-steps\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">From Composer to published landing</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Ship a marketing page without spinning up a separate frontend.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Step 1</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Install Core</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">composer require voodflow/voodbuilder, run voodbuilder:install, register the Filament plugin and build Vite assets.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Step 2</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Compose the page</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Open a Site Page, drop Elements or local sections, style with tokens, save as a template or import a JSON kit.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Step 3</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Publish</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Visitors get the live page with compiled CSS, chrome layout and menu routes — still inside Laravel.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg-alt py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-library\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">Library</p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">Three ways to build faster</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Clear roles in the editor sidebar — so teams know what is provided, what they author, and what they ship as pages.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Elements</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Provided catalog</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Official remote sections from Voodflow — heroes, features, CTAs and more — ready to drop into the canvas.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Components</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Your reusable blocks</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Save page fragments as Components, reuse them across pages, keep CSS scoped and under your control.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Templates</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Full pages &amp; marketplace</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Import JSON kits, replace or append content, and prepare for shared / marketplace page templates.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-resources\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mb-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-end\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-xl space-y-2\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">Resources</p>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">Learn VoodBuilder</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-vp-text-2\">Docs and guides to go from first install to polished landings.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-vp-brand-1\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">View all on voodflow.com →</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4\">\n      <article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=360&q=80\" alt=\"Getting started with VoodBuilder\" class=\"h-40 w-full max-w-full object-cover sm:h-36\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"space-y-2 p-5\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Install &amp; first page</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-vp-text-2\">Composer, Vite build, Filament plugin and your first Site Page.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=360&q=80\" alt=\"Theme and design tokens\" class=\"h-40 w-full max-w-full object-cover sm:h-36\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"space-y-2 p-5\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Theme tokens</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-vp-text-2\">How bg-vp-* utilities keep landings readable in dark mode.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=360&q=80\" alt=\"Page templates and development\" class=\"h-40 w-full max-w-full object-cover sm:h-36\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"space-y-2 p-5\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Page templates</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-vp-text-2\">Import JSON, replace vs append, and JIT compile on apply.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=360&q=80\" alt=\"Companion packages and teamwork\" class=\"h-40 w-full max-w-full object-cover sm:h-36\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"space-y-2 p-5\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Companions</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-vp-text-2\">When to add Elements, Components, Dynamic Data or Popups.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section bg-vp-bg-alt py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-faq\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-vp-brand-1\">FAQ</p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base text-vp-text-2\">Straight answers for teams evaluating VoodBuilder.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4\">\n      <details class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-5 ring-1 ring-black/5\" open>\n        <summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Why VoodBuilder instead of a separate headless CMS?</summary>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">You keep auth, policies, queues and deploy in Laravel. Editors work in Filament. Public pages are Blade + compiled Tailwind — no second frontend repo to maintain.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-5 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">What do I need to start?</summary>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">PHP 8.4+, Laravel 12/13, Filament 5, Node for Vite, and voodflow/vmedia. Run composer require voodflow/voodbuilder -W and php artisan voodbuilder:install.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-5 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Is Community really free?</summary>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Yes — Community is free to use (see the package LICENSE). Paid add-ons on voodflow.com unlock authoring companions such as Elements, Components and advanced Templates.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-5 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Elements vs Components vs Templates?</summary>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Elements are the provided remote catalog. Components are reusable blocks you save. Templates are full-page kits (import/export today, marketplace next).</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"rounded-2xl bg-vp-bg-elv p-5 ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n        <summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">How does Tailwind get compiled?</summary>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">The host app’s Vite builds theme CSS. Page utilities are JIT-compiled for the canvas on apply and recompiled on Save for visitors.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section border-y border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg py-16 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-stats\">\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container w-full px-4 sm:px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-center lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Editor</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Visual + Tailwind</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Filament 5</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Admin editors know</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Themes</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Studio &amp; sub-themes</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Companions</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Grow when you need</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"voodbuilder-editor-section relative overflow-hidden bg-vp-bg-alt py-20 text-vp-text-2\" data-voodbuilder-section-block=\"vb-voodflow-landing-cta\">\n  <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1/15 blur-3xl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-vp-brand-2/10 blur-3xl\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"voodbuilder-editor-container relative z-10 w-full px-5\" data-voodbuilder-role=\"content\" data-voodbuilder-content-width=\"normal\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-center\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"copy\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-vp-text-1 sm:text-4xl\">Laravel + Tailwind CSS, with a visual builder</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Install VoodBuilder Community, register the Filament plugin, run Vite — then open a Site Page and start composing. Add companions when the product needs more.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\" data-voodbuilder-dropzone=\"actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit max-w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl bg-vp-brand-1 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-vp-bg transition hover:bg-vp-brand-2 sm:px-7 sm:py-3 sm:text-sm\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">Get started</a>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit max-w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-vp-text-1 transition hover:bg-vp-bg sm:px-7 sm:py-3 sm:text-sm\" data-voodbuilder-cta=\"true\">See features</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
